  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NGFadama Information&amp;Knowledge Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to establish sustainable, Fadama information, knowledge and business advisory services centers (FIKS) to increase farm productivity and rural household incomes in the poorest sections of the Fadama community in Cross River, Lagos, Sokoto and Yobe states over a four year period using a variety of information and communication technologies.</narrative>
  </description>
